# Agent Prompts: ECC Agent References

Spec: AgentPromptsIndex
Purpose:
  Index of summarized ECC agent prompts mapped to SDD roles.
  Stores human-readable summaries (NOT full MIT-licensed text) with
  links to the ECC repository for details.

Owns: agent/prompts/INDEX.sdd

Structure:
  Prompt summaries are .sdd files with @prompt.PXX IDs.
  Each summary includes: ecc_agent, sdd_role, purpose, capabilities, prompt_path

Rules:
  [PROMPT-01] Store summaries only — link to ECC repository for full text.
  [PROMPT-02] Each prompt MUST reference its SDD role.
  [PROMPT-03] Prompts are versioned to track ECC updates.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  Roles: @../roles.sdd
  EccBridge: @../ecc-bridge.sdd
  ImportPlan: @../../evolution/import-plan.sdd
  Capabilities: @../capabilities.sdd

State: +
